353
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:07,880
什么是凯菲啊
What's a Carvel?

354
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:10,200
凯菲冰激凌啊
Carvel ice cream.

355
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:12,540
他们的软糖鲸鱼 饼干猫没听过吗
You know, Fudgie the Whale, Cookie Puss.

356
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:14,600
不是吧 怎么可能没听过凯菲冰激凌
Come on, how could you not know Carvel?

357
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:15,480
他们的冰激凌车随处可见
They have them everywhere.

358
00:15:15,900 --> 00:15:16,620
等等
Oh, wait.

359
00:15:16,620 --> 00:15:18,000
就是穷苦白人吃的冰激凌吗
Is that that white trash ice cream?

360
00:15:19,040 --> 00:15:20,160
你再说一次试试
How dare you!

361
00:15:20,300 --> 00:15:21,780
才不是穷苦白人吃的
It is not white trash.

362
00:15:21,980 --> 00:15:23,500
而且你也别装什么高贵了
And I wouldn't be so high and mighty.

363
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:25,220
你正坐在通往监狱的免费巴士上呢
You're on a free bangbus to a prison.

364
00:15:25,700 --> 00:15:26,520
真是抱歉哦
I'm sorry.

365
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:27,660
我没想到你对冰激凌
I didn't realize you had such

366
00:15:27,660 --> 00:15:29,700
有如此强烈的感情
a strong emotional connection to ice cream.

367
00:15:29,820 --> 00:15:33,100
不是冰激凌 是冰激凌蛋糕
Not to the ice cream. The ice cream cake.

368
00:15:33,100 --> 00:15:36,420
我十岁时 我让我妈给我办生日派对
When I was ten, I asked my mom for a birthday party.

369
00:15:36,820 --> 00:15:38,300
她答应之后 又睡过去了
She said yes but then flaked out

370
00:15:38,300 --> 00:15:39,440
没邀请任何人来
and forgot to call anyone.

371
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:41,020
现在我懂为什么
I'm starting to understand why

372
00:15:41,020 --> 00:15:42,160
你不喜欢生日派对了
you don't like birthday parties.

373
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:44,860
我在阳台干等了一个小时后
So after I waited on the porch for an hour,

374
00:15:45,020 --> 00:15:46,520
就去她皮包偷了20块
I'll stole 20 bucks from her purse,

375
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:47,860
拦了一辆冰激凌车
thumbed it out to Carvel,

376
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:49,700
然后买了软糖鲸鱼冰激凌蛋糕吃
and bought myself a Fudgie the Whale cake.

377
00:15:50,500 --> 00:15:52,340
用一根小粉勺把它全部吃光
Ate the whole thing with a pink plastic spoon,

378
00:15:52,340 --> 00:15:55,080
那种幸福感 是任何生日派对都比不上的
and it was way better than any party ever could have been.

379
00:15:55,640 --> 00:15:56,680
我全听见了
I heard that.

380
00:15:56,920 --> 00:15:58,340
软糖鲸鱼冰激凌蛋糕最棒了
There ain't nothing better than Fudgie the Whale.

381
00:15:58,780 --> 00:16:00,320
我最爱巧克力碎果仁口味
I love the chocolate crunchies.

382
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:02,940
白痴 谁不爱那个口味啊
Bitch, everybody love the damn chocolate crunchies!

383
00:16:08,180 --> 00:16:09,880
珊妲 你是来探视谁呢
Hey, Shonda. Who are you here to see?

384
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:10,820
谁有空啊
Who's available?

385
00:16:12,020 --> 00:16:14,000
开玩笑嘛 我当然是来找蠕爷的
I'm just cracking wise. You know I'm here to see Squirm.

386
00:16:16,738 --> 00:16:18,520
搜查她全身吧
Search her.

387
00:16:18,520 --> 00:16:19,840
靠 怎么又是我
Damn. Is it my turn again?

388
00:16:22,340 --> 00:16:22,740
下一位
Next.

389
00:16:23,680 --> 00:16:25,380
我们没在名单上 我们没预约
We're not on that list. We didn't call ahead.

390
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:26,500
我来处理
Leave it to me.

391
00:16:26,560 --> 00:16:28,760
我没有想进却进不去的地方
I've gotten into every club I've ever wanted to get into.

392
00:16:29,900 --> 00:16:31,600
卡洛琳·钱宁 带一朋友
Hi. Caroline Channing plus one.

393
00:16:32,220 --> 00:16:33,640
你不在名单上啊
I don't see you on the list.

394
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:35,420
真的吗 怪事
Really? That's weird.

395
00:16:35,420 --> 00:16:37,440
我们应该在名单上啊 一直都是这样
We should be on the list. We're always on the list.

396
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:39,000
麦克斯 我们不在名单上
Max, we're not on the list.

397
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:41,780
不在名单上吗 我要宰了我助理
We're not? I'm going to kill my assistant.

398
00:16:43,620 --> 00:16:45,060
我知道了
Oh, I know.

399
00:16:45,060 --> 00:16:47,680
应该是在德安杰洛·杰佛逊的名下吧
It might be under Deangelo Jefferson.

400
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:50,060
女士们 别浪费我时间了
Come on, girls. Don't waste my time.

401
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:51,920
我要见你们主管
I'd like to see a manager.

402
00:16:55,780 --> 00:16:57,080
这里没有主管
There's no manager.

403
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:58,260
这里是监狱
It's a prison.

404
00:16:59,400 --> 00:17:01,238
那这里谁管事
Well, then who runs this place?

405
00:17:01,238 --> 00:17:03,696
雅利安兄弟会最近势力挺庞大的
Well, the Aryan brotherhood is getting pretty strong.

406
00:17:07,520 --> 00:17:09,200
真是石头脑袋不开窍
This is such amateur hour.

407
00:17:09,260 --> 00:17:10,660
给我50块塞给这看门的吧
Give me 50 bucks for the door guy.

408
00:17:11,620 --> 00:17:13,240
你不会是真想在
Are you seriously trying to bribe

409
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:15,580
监狱里贿赂一名警官吧
an officer of the law while inside a prison?

410
00:17:17,340 --> 00:17:18,700
这可是重罪
That's a federal offense.

411
00:17:19,140 --> 00:17:19,880
真的吗
Is it?

412
00:17:21,180 --> 00:17:21,660
应该吧
Probably.

413
00:17:23,580 --> 00:17:26,060
光冲着你们这想法 我就该把你们轰出去
Look, I should have you thrown out for even suggesting it.

414
00:17:26,120 --> 00:17:27,400
我们这里不收贿赂
We do not accept bribes.

415
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:28,880
好吧 好吧
Okay, fine.

416
00:17:28,980 --> 00:17:31,260
如果你放我们进去 做全身检查时
I'll let you take your sweet time searching me

417
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:32,480
我让你检查"到底"呢
on the way in.

418
00:17:33,580 --> 00:17:34,840
这两位女士可以进去了
These two are clear to go through.

419
00:17:36,780 --> 00:17:38,620
麦克斯 你不需要为我这么牺牲
Max, you can't do that for me.

420
00:17:38,740 --> 00:17:40,460
我是为了自己 好久没人"碰"过我了
It's really for me. It's been a while.

421
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:41,780
哟呵 哟呵
Woot, woot.

422
00:17:45,420 --> 00:17:47,160
等了这么久
I'm so excited to see my father

423
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:48,220
终于能见我爸了
after all this time.

424
00:17:48,400 --> 00:17:49,320
我看起来如何
How do I look?

425
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:50,980
你看起来挺好 我呢
You look good. How do I look?

426
00:17:51,140 --> 00:17:52,760
还有着刚被人"检查"完的光彩吗
Do I still have that freshly felt-up glow?

427
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:57,180
那边的红发男对你挺有兴趣呢
Well, that ginger over there thinks you look good.

428
00:17:57,220 --> 00:17:58,660
他目不转睛地盯着你呢
He's full-on staring at you.

429
00:17:58,660 --> 00:18:00,720
没人看才惨呢
Well, I should hope so.

430
00:18:00,900 --> 00:18:02,780
在母猪都能赛貂蝉的监狱里都没人看
If you can't get a dude in prison to check you out,

431
00:18:02,800 --> 00:18:03,840
你就该去野猪大改造了
it's time for a makeover.

432
00:18:05,580 --> 00:18:07,380
不是 他是边打量边点头
No, he's looking and nodding

433
00:18:07,380 --> 00:18:08,420
好像认识你似的
like he knows you.

434
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,440
素未蒙面 绝对不认识
Never seen him before in my life.

435
00:18:14,720 --> 00:18:15,100
麦克斯
Max?

436
00:18:15,780 --> 00:18:16,560
麦克斯·布莱克
Max Black?

437
00:18:17,820 --> 00:18:19,260
是我啊 爱尔兰男啊
It's me, Irish.

438
00:18:19,700 --> 00:18:21,780
你说啥呢 兄弟 认错人了吧
I don't know, dude. I think you got the wrong girl.

439
00:18:22,100 --> 00:18:23,900
麦克斯 我永远不会忘记你的样子
Max, I could never forget that face.

440
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:26,560
相信我 我们绝对素未蒙面
Trust me, you've never seen me before.

441
00:18:28,500 --> 00:18:29,460
哇靠
Oh, damn!

442
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:31,040
我的天啊
Oh, my God!

443
00:18:32,060 --> 00:18:32,940
是你耶
That's you.

444
00:18:33,600 --> 00:18:34,780
现在记得了吧
So you do remember.

445
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:35,880
当然记得
Of course.

446
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:38,520
帮我甩掉他 我跟他只是一夜情
Get rid of him. It was a one-night stand.

447
00:18:39,460 --> 00:18:41,280
看吧 果真是会回来死缠烂打的
See, they do come back to haunt you.

448
00:18:41,540 --> 00:18:42,080
衣服穿好
Shirt on.

449
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:44,540
麦克斯 你敢相信吗
Max, can you believe it?

450
00:18:44,540 --> 00:18:46,160
世界上有那么多监狱
Of all the prisons in all the world,

451
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:47,300
你却走进我这家
you walked into mine.

452
00:18:47,520 --> 00:18:48,200
这就是命运
It's kismet.

453
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:50,780
我帮过你 现在轮到你帮我了
I got rid of yours. You get rid of mine.

454
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:54,540
听我说 爱尔兰男 当年只是一夜春宵
Listen, Irish. It was a one-time thing.

455
00:18:54,660 --> 00:18:56,120
你是男人 你懂得吧
You're a guy. You get that.

456
00:18:56,120 --> 00:18:58,140
可一夜夫妻白日恩啊
How could you say it's a one-time thing?

457
00:18:58,360 --> 00:18:59,440
我爱你
I love you.

458
00:18:59,560 --> 00:19:01,360
我为你炸了那间墨西哥餐馆呢
I blew up that chipotle for you.

459
00:19:03,260 --> 00:19:05,000
我很感谢你为我纹身
Listen, I appreciate the ink,

460
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:07,080
但我不相信爱情
but I don't really believe in love,

461
00:19:07,140 --> 00:19:07,860
而且老实说
and truth be told,

462
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:09,900
我根本不爱墨西哥菜
I'm not even a fan of Mexican food.

463
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:12,320
卡洛琳·钱宁 这桌
Caroline Channing. This table.

464
00:19:12,540 --> 00:19:14,000
麦克斯 我们坐过去吧 我老爸要来了
Max, we have to go. My dad's coming.

465
00:19:14,580 --> 00:19:16,020
好了 很高兴与你重逢 爱尔兰男
Okay. Nice to see you, Irish.

466
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:17,599
你的身材看起来酷毙了
Your body looks sick.

467
00:19:17,599 --> 00:19:18,581
麦克斯 等等
Max, hold on.

468
00:19:18,781 --> 00:19:20,184
这是最后一次警告
I'm not going to tell you again to back up.

469
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:21,780
麦克斯 我不想再次失去你
Max, I'm not going to lose you twice.

470
00:19:21,820 --> 00:19:22,820
我说了 退后
I said, back up!

471
00:19:22,900 --> 00:19:24,160
别叫我退后
Don't tell me to back up.

472
00:19:24,180 --> 00:19:25,420
她是我一生的挚爱
That's the love of my life.

473
00:19:25,420 --> 00:19:27,120
兄弟 有多远滚多远吧
Come on, dude. Hit the pike.

474
00:19:28,020 --> 00:19:28,680
冷静下来
Calm down.

475
00:19:28,860 --> 00:19:30,400
别叫我冷静
Don't tell me to calm down!

476
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:36,600
会面时间结束 所有人出去
Visiting hours are over! Everybody out!

477
00:19:36,660 --> 00:19:38,219
不不不 不行 我不能走
No, no, no, wait! I can't leave.

478
00:19:38,219 --> 00:19:39,574
靠
Damn!

479
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,440
等等 那是我老爸
Oh, wait. There's my father.

480
00:19:42,520 --> 00:19:43,820
我看到他的身影了 他要出来了
I can see him, he's just coming in.

481
00:19:43,940 --> 00:19:45,440
老爸 老爸 看到我了吗
Oh, daddy. Daddy... Hi!

482
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:49,520
感谢你们俩全家啊 小姐们
Well, thank you very much, ladies.

483
00:19:49,940 --> 00:19:52,160
我男人才刚"进入" 我就被"拉出"了
My man was barely in when I got pulled out.

484
00:19:53,300 --> 00:19:56,700
我想给大家道个歉
I would like to apologize to everyone

485
00:19:56,700 --> 00:19:58,960
害开搞巴士的各位开搞失败
for taking the bang out of the bus,

486
00:19:59,340 --> 00:20:01,220
我想为自己解释
but in my own defense,

487
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:04,040
在座各位也都懂疯子疯起来的样子嘛
everyone here knows a little something about crazy guys.

488
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:06,420
屁股给我乖乖粘回椅子上
Sit yo ass back down!

489
00:20:06,620 --> 00:20:08,580
麦克斯赶紧坐下吧 不然等会又暴动了
Max, sit down before you start another riot.

490
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:11,180
对不起 我搞砸了一切
I'm sorry. I blew it.

491
00:20:11,320 --> 00:20:12,960
我搞砸了你见你老爸的机会
I screwed up your chance to see your father.

492
00:20:13,040 --> 00:20:14,140
我办砸了你的派对
I screwed up your party.

493
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:16,840
我连庆祝生日最简单的方式
I even screwed up the easiest birthday thing to do,

494
00:20:16,840 --> 00:20:17,580
买个蛋糕都不会
like get a cake.

495
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:19,400
我真是个超烂死党
I'm a terrible BFF.

496
00:20:19,820 --> 00:20:20,620
没关系的
It's okay.

497
00:20:21,140 --> 00:20:22,640
真的没关系
Really, it's fine.

498
00:20:23,040 --> 00:20:23,980
今年我经历的一切
With the year I'm having,

499
00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:25,640
也不是你随便买个蛋糕
it's not like you could've made everything better

500
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:26,780
就能好转起来的
just by getting me a cake.

501
00:20:28,420 --> 00:20:30,420
的确 普通的蛋糕不行
Well, no. Not just any cake.

502
00:20:34,680 --> 00:20:36,740
跟我记忆中的一样美味
Just as good as I remember it.

503
00:20:36,740 --> 00:20:38,660
我们花得最值的40块
Best 40 bucks we ever spent.

504
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:41,360
这个生日其实也不错嘛
And this birthday turned out to be all right.

505
00:20:41,520 --> 00:20:42,940
我的愿望有实现
I did get what I wanted.

506
00:20:43,020 --> 00:20:44,120
我见到了我老爸
I got see my father.

507
00:20:44,620 --> 00:20:47,100
虽然只有短暂的一秒 但的确是见到了
It was only for a second, but I saw him.

508
00:20:47,100 --> 00:20:49,200
他也看见我了 所以谢谢你
And he saw me. So thank you.

509
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:51,800
是啊 我也跟爱尔兰男重逢了
Yeah, and I got to see Irish.

510
00:20:52,860 --> 00:20:54,180
或许跟他是情深缘浅
Think he might be the one that got away.

511
00:20:55,020 --> 00:20:56,260
警察还对他抓住不放呢
Well, the one that got put away.

512
00:20:57,160 --> 00:20:59,300
我跟你可不只是超级死党哦
You know, you and I are better than BFFs.

513
00:20:59,620 --> 00:21:01,080
我们是搞巴死党
We're BBFs.

514
00:21:01,080 --> 00:21:03,290
开搞巴士死党
Bangbus friends.
